sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户/前台
    participant FW as ForegroundWatcher
    participant SC as ScreenPerception
    participant ESM as EmotionStateMachine
    participant MEM as CompanionMemory
    participant ES as EventStream
    participant SM as SceneMemory
    participant CL as SceneCluster(纯函数)
    participant PRO as ProactiveScheduler
    participant HAN as HanakoMonitor
    participant PS as PetStatusMapper
    participant REN as AvatarRenderer(Sprite/Live2D/VRM)
    participant TTS as tts_provider/api_tts.py
    participant HTTP as PetStatusHTTPServer

    %% ===== A/B: 事件流写入（前台切换） =====
    U->>FW: 切换前台窗口(app_category)
    FW->>MEM: on_change → record_activity(category)
    FW->>MEM: record_event(category, start_ts, end_ts)
    MEM->>ES: append({ts, category, emotion…})
    ES->>ESM: emotion_provider 快照当前情绪(B)
    ES-->>MEM: 单行 JSONL append(损坏隔离)

    %% ===== A/B: 视觉 ActivityEvent 写入 =====
    SC->>SC: _activity_history.append(activity)
    SC->>MEM: EventBus.emit("activity_event", event)
    MEM->>ES: append({category, start_ts, end_ts…})

    %% ===== C: 收盘聚类 =====
    MEM->>ES: read_events(30)
    ES-->>MEM: list[EventRecord]
    MEM->>CL: cluster_events(events)
    CL-->>MEM: list[Scene]
    MEM->>SM: rebuild(scenes) → <agent_id>_scenes.json

    %% ===== D: 场景回忆触发 =====
    PRO->>PRO: tick()（冷却/全屏/打扰守卫通过）
    PRO->>PRO: _try_recall(signals)
    PRO->>SM: find_matching(category, scenario, tags)
    SM-->>PRO: Scene
    PRO->>U: on_proactive(回忆台词, 30min 冷却)

    %% ===== G: celebrating 触发链路 =====
    HAN->>HAN: map_event_to_mood(tool_end, success=True)
    HAN-->>HAN: mood="celebrating", emotion="happy"
    HAN->>PS: on_state_change(anim, msg, emotion, state=celebrating)
    PS->>PS: render_for("celebrating", REN)
    PS->>REN: play_anim(celebrate/complete) + set_emotion(happy)
    REN-->>PS: 主线程执行(不碰 C 层)
    PS->>TTS: 后台线程 synthesize("完成啦！")
    TTS-->>PS: audio_path(信号回主线程)
    PS->>REN: 气泡"完成啦！" + 3s 后回 idle

    %% ===== F: 本地状态口 =====
    HTTP->>HTTP: GET /pet/state (127.0.0.1:8977, X-Auth-Token)
    HTTP->>PS: state_provider() 读 6 态 + emotion + scenario
    PS-->>HTTP: JSON 响应(只读)
    HTTP->>HTTP: POST /pet/set-mode {"mode":"celebrating"}
    HTTP->>HTTP: 白名单校验 → EventBus.emit("pet_set_mode")
    HTTP->>PS: 信号转主线程 → render_for(mode)
